program	conformance/Z03_replace_container_during_window.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	differs
expect	error
build	refused	exclusive access violation: the place `v[0]` borrows `v` for the whole window, and `v` is accessed by reference a second time in the same call
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: exclusive access violation: the place `v[0]` borrows `v` for the whole window, and `v` is accessed by reference a second time in the same call"
log	"  --> examples/conformance/Z03_replace_container_during_window.saw:17:10"
log	"     |"
log	" 17 |     sink(&var v[0], clobber(&var v))"
log	"     |          ^"
log	"   hint: a place borrow charges its ROOT, so two windows onto one receiver — or a window beside a `&var` of it — cannot both be open. Open them in SEPARATE statements, or reach for the method that does both at once (`v.swap(i, j)`)"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
